# ==============================================================================
# PFM PULSE — COLECAO OFICIAL DE HOMOLOGACAO LOCAL E2E (8 JORNADAS)
# Compatible with: VS Code REST Client, IntelliJ HTTP Client, Insomnia, Postman
# Target: pfm-ingestion-bff-go (http://localhost:8080)
# Currency: 100% BRL (R$) | BigDecimal precision | Zero-Trust LGPD (ADR-006)
# ==============================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@tenantA = 11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111
@tenantB = 22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222
@ownerA = aaaaaaaa-1111-1111-1111-111111111111
@viewerA = bbbbbbbb-1111-1111-1111-111111111111
@ownerB = cccccccc-2222-2222-2222-222222222222
@platformAdmin = 99999999-9999-9999-9999-999999999999

# ==============================================================================
# JORNADA 1 — AUTENTICACAO, ONBOARDING DE TENANT & ISOLAMENTO RLS
# ==============================================================================

### [J1-HAPPY-1] Emitir JWT Local para Tenant A (Familia Dantas - OWNER)
# @name authTenantA
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/dev-token
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tenant_id": "{{tenantA}}",
  "user_id": "{{ownerA}}",
  "role": "OWNER",
  "email": "dantas@pfmpulse.com.br"
}

### [J1-HAPPY-2] Emitir JWT Local para Tenant B (Familia Visitante - OWNER)
# @name authTenantB
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/dev-token
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tenant_id": "{{tenantB}}",
  "user_id": "{{ownerB}}",
  "role": "OWNER",
  "email": "visitante@pfmpulse.com.br"
}

### [J1-HAPPY-3] Emitir JWT Local para Membro VIEWER do Tenant A
# @name authViewerA
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/dev-token
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tenant_id": "{{tenantA}}",
  "user_id": "{{viewerA}}",
  "role": "VIEWER",
  "email": "dependente@pfmpulse.com.br"
}

### [J1-HAPPY-4] Emitir JWT Local para PLATFORM_ADMIN (SaaS Backoffice)
# @name authPlatformAdmin
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/dev-token
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tenant_id": "{{tenantA}}",
  "user_id": "{{platformAdmin}}",
  "role": "PLATFORM_ADMIN",
  "email": "sre-admin@soroban.com.br"
}

### [J1-HAPPY-5] Healthcheck BFF Go (HTTP/2 + Alt-Svc HTTP/3 Ready)
GET {{baseUrl}}/health
Accept: application/json

### [J1-SAD-1] Requisicao sem Header X-Tenant-ID / JWT -> Esperado: 401 Unauthorized
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/dashboard/summary
Accept: application/json

### [J1-SAD-2] Requisicao com X-Tenant-ID Malformado -> Esperado: 401 Unauthorized
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/dashboard/summary
X-Tenant-ID: invalid-uuid-format
Accept: application/json

# ==============================================================================
# JORNADA 2 — GESTAO DE CARTOES DE CREDITO & LANCAMENTOS (CRUD COMPLETO)
# ==============================================================================

### [J2-HAPPY-1] Cadastrar Cartao de Credito Itau Personnalite (Final 5285, Limite R$ 15.000,00)
# @name createCardA
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/cards
Authorization: Bearer {{authTenantA.response.body.access_token}}
X-Tenant-ID: {{tenantA}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Itau Personnalite Black",
  "issuer": "ITAU",
  "last4": "5285",
  "credit_limit": "15000.00",
  "closing_day": 20,
  "due_day": 28
}

### [J2-HAPPY-2] Criar Lancamento a Vista (R$ 245,90 - Supermercado Pao de Acucar)
# @name createSpotTx
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/transactions
Authorization: Bearer {{authTenantA.response.body.access_token}}
X-Tenant-ID: {{tenantA}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "card_id": "{{createCardA.response.body.card_id}}",
  "merchant_name": "SUPERMERCADO PAO DE ACUCAR",
  "amount": "245.90",
  "currency": "BRL",
  "category_code": "ALIMENTACAO :: SUPERMERCADO",
  "installments": 1,
  "transaction_date": "2026-11-10"
}

### [J2-HAPPY-3] Criar Lancamento Parcelado 10x (R$ 4.500,00 - Apple Store 01/10 a 10/10)
# Sensibiliza o limite total em R$ 4.500,00 e projeta 10 parcelas de R$ 450,00 (RN02)
# @name createInstallmentTx
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/transactions
Authorization: Bearer {{authTenantA.response.body.access_token}}
X-Tenant-ID: {{tenantA}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "card_id": "{{createCardA.response.body.card_id}}",
  "merchant_name": "APPLE STORE BRASIL",
  "amount": "4500.00",
  "currency": "BRL",
  "category_code": "ESTILO_DE_VIDA :: ELETRONICOS",
  "installments": 10,
  "transaction_date": "2026-11-12"
}

### [J2-HAPPY-4] Editar Categoria e Observacao de Lancamento Existente (PATCH)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/transactions/{{createSpotTx.response.body.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authTenantA.response.body.access_token}}
X-Tenant-ID: {{tenantA}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "category_code": "ALIMENTACAO :: FEIRA_E_HORTIFRUTI",
  "notes": "Compra mensal organicos auditada"
}

### [J2-HAPPY-5] Registrar Estorno / Credito na Mesma Categoria Original (RN03 - R$ 245,90)
# @name refundSpotTx
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/transactions/{{createSpotTx.response.body.id}}/refund
Authorization: Bearer {{authTenantA.response.body.access_token}}
X-Tenant-ID: {{tenantA}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": "245.90",
  "reason": "Cobranca duplicada estornada pelo estabelecimento"
}

### [J2-SAD-1] Criar Lancamento com Valor Negativo (-10.00) -> Esperado: 400 Bad Request
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/transactions
Authorization: Bearer {{authTenantA.response.body.access_token}}
X-Tenant-ID: {{tenantA}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "merchant_name": "LANCAMENTO INVALIDO NEGATIVO",
  "amount": "-10.00",
  "currency": "BRL",
  "category_code": "OUTROS",
  "installments": 1
}

### [J2-SAD-2] Criar Lancamento com Valor Zero (0.00) -> Esperado: 400 Bad Request
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/transactions
Authorization: Bearer {{authTenantA.response.body.access_token}}
X-Tenant-ID: {{tenantA}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "merchant_name": "LANCAMENTO INVALIDO ZERO",
  "amount": "0.00",
  "currency": "BRL",
  "category_code": "OUTROS",
  "installments": 1
}

### [J2-SAD-3] Criar Lancamento com Data Invalida -> Esperado: 400 Bad Request
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/transactions
Authorization: Bearer {{authTenantA.response.body.access_token}}
X-Tenant-ID: {{tenantA}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "merchant_name": "DATA INVALIDA",
  "amount": "50.00",
  "currency": "BRL",
  "transaction_date": "2026-99-99"
}

### [J2-SAD-4] Criar Lancamento com Parcelas = 0 -> Esperado: 400 Bad Request
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/transactions
Authorization: Bearer {{authTenantA.response.body.access_token}}
X-Tenant-ID: {{tenantA}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "merchant_name": "PARCELA ZERO",
  "amount": "150.00",
  "currency": "BRL",
  "installments": 0
}

### [J2-SAD-5] Membro VIEWER tentando Criar ou Deletar Lancamento -> Esperado: 403 Forbidden
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/transactions/{{createInstallmentTx.response.body.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authViewerA.response.body.access_token}}
X-Tenant-ID: {{tenantA}}

### [J1-SAD-3] Cross-Tenant Access: Tenant B tentando ler Transacao do Tenant A -> Esperado: 404 Not Found
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/transactions/{{createInstallmentTx.response.body.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authTenantB.response.body.access_token}}
X-Tenant-ID: {{tenantB}}

# ==============================================================================
# JORNADA 3 — INGESTAO DE FATURA PDF EM RAM (ZERO-PERSISTENCE) & CHECKSUM (RN04)
# ==============================================================================

### [J3-HAPPY-1] Upload de Fatura PDF Valida em RAM (Soma Itens == Total Declarado R$ 750,90)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/statements/upload
Authorization: Bearer {{authTenantA.response.body.access_token}}
X-Tenant-ID: {{tenantA}}
X-Statement-Issuer: ITAU
X-Card-Last4: 5285
X-File-Name: fatura-itau-2026-11.pdf
Content-Type: application/pdf

ISSUER: ITAU | CARD: 5285 | REF: 2026-11 | DUE: 2026-11-28 | TOTAL: 750.90
2026-11-05 | SUPERMERCADO PAO DE ACUCAR | 250.00
2026-11-06 | APPLE STORE BRASIL 02/10 | 450.00
2026-11-08 | DROGASIL FARMACIA | 41.00
2026-11-10 | TARIFA ITAU AVISA SMS | 9.90

### [J3-SAD-1] Fatura com Divergencia de Soma (Itens R$ 700,00 != Total R$ 750,90) -> Esperado: 409 Conflict (RN04)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/statements/upload
Authorization: Bearer {{authTenantA.response.body.access_token}}
X-Tenant-ID: {{tenantA}}
X-Statement-Issuer: ITAU
X-Card-Last4: 5285
X-File-Name: fatura-divergente.pdf
Content-Type: application/pdf

ISSUER: ITAU | CARD: 5285 | REF: 2026-11 | DUE: 2026-11-28 | TOTAL: 750.90
2026-11-05 | SUPERMERCADO PAO DE ACUCAR | 250.00
2026-11-06 | APPLE STORE BRASIL 02/10 | 450.00

### [J3-SAD-2] Upload de Arquivo Executavel (.exe / MZ Header) -> Esperado: 415 Unsupported Media Type
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/statements/upload
Authorization: Bearer {{authTenantA.response.body.access_token}}
X-Tenant-ID: {{tenantA}}
X-File-Name: malware.exe
Content-Type: application/x-msdownload

MZ_FAKE_EXECUTABLE_BINARY_STREAM

# ==============================================================================
# JORNADA 4 — INGESTAO DE CUPOM FISCAL SEFAZ (NFC-e) & INFLACAO PESSOAL POR SKU
# ==============================================================================

### [J4-HAPPY-1] Ingerir Nota Fiscal NFC-e 1 (Azeite Extra Virgem 500ml a R$ 39,90)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/receipts/nfce
Authorization: Bearer {{authTenantA.response.body.access_token}}
X-Tenant-ID: {{tenantA}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "access_key": "35261112345678000199650010000123451000123451",
  "merchant_name": "CARREFOUR HIPERMERCADO LTDA",
  "total_amount": "39.90",
  "items": [
    {
      "ean": "7891234567890",
      "description": "AZEITE EXTRA VIRGEM PORTUGUES 500ML",
      "quantity": "1.000",
      "unit_price": "39.90"
    }
  ]
}

