POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/receipts/nfce
Authorization: Bearer {{authTenantA.response.body.access_token}}
X-Tenant-ID: {{tenantA}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "access_key": "35261112345678000199650010000123451000123452",
  "merchant_name": "PAO DE ACUCAR COMPASS",
  "total_amount": "47.90",
  "items": [
    {
      "ean": "7891234567890",
      "description": "AZEITE EXTRA VIRGEM PORTUGUES 500ML",
      "quantity": "1.000",
      "unit_price": "47.90"
    }
  ]
}

### [J4-SAD-1] Reenviar Mesma Chave NFC-e de 44 Digitos (Idempotencia) -> Esperado: 409 Conflict
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/receipts/nfce
Authorization: Bearer {{authTenantA.response.body.access_token}}
X-Tenant-ID: {{tenantA}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "access_key": "35261112345678000199650010000123451000123451",
