}

# ==============================================================================
# JORNADA 5 — PIPELINE KAFKA, CATEGORIZACAO IA & INBOX ZERO ("OUTROS < 5%")
# ==============================================================================

### [J5-HAPPY-1] Consultar Fila Inbox Zero (< 5% Nao Categorizado)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/inbox
Authorization: Bearer {{authTenantA.response.body.access_token}}
X-Tenant-ID: {{tenantA}}

### [J5-HAPPY-2] Confirmar Sugestao de Categoria no Inbox Zero com Aprendizado de Regra
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/inbox/inbox-001/confirm
Authorization: Bearer {{authTenantA.response.body.access_token}}
X-Tenant-ID: {{tenantA}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "approved_category_code": "ALIMENTACAO :: DELIVERY_APLICATIVOS",
  "learn_rule": true
}

### [J5-SAD-1] Publicar Evento Malformado / Corrompido -> Roteado para Topico tx.dlq (202 Accepted)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/inbox/dlq-test
Authorization: Bearer {{authTenantA.response.body.access_token}}
X-Tenant-ID: {{tenantA}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "corrupted": true,
  "raw_payload": "<<<INVALID_KAFKA_PROTO_STREAM>>>"
}

# ==============================================================================
# JORNADA 6 — MOTOR DE PREVISIBILIDADE ("LIVRE PARA GASTAR") & SIMULADOR SAC/PRICE
# ==============================================================================

### [J6-HAPPY-1] Consultar "Livre para Gastar" (Horizonte MONTH / WEEK / TODAY)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/dashboard/summary?horizon=MONTH&scope=FAMILY
Authorization: Bearer {{authTenantA.response.body.access_token}}
X-Tenant-ID: {{tenantA}}

