# ==============================================================================
# JORNADA 7 — GOVERNANCA FAMILIAR, TETO DE GASTOS & CRYPTO-SHREDDING LGPD
# ==============================================================================

### [J7-HAPPY-1] Configurar Teto Mensal (R$ 1.500,00 para Alimentacao Fora, Alerta 80%)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/profile/budgets
Authorization: Bearer {{authTenantA.response.body.access_token}}
X-Tenant-ID: {{tenantA}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "category_id": "alimentacao-fora",
  "category_name": "Alimentacao Fora",
  "monthly_cap": "1500.00",
  "threshold_percentage": 80
}

### [J7-HAPPY-2] Convidar Membro Familiar (MEMBER com Alerta de Teto R$ 1.200,00)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/profile/members
Authorization: Bearer {{authTenantA.response.body.access_token}}
X-Tenant-ID: {{tenantA}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "conjuge@pfmpulse.com.br",
  "full_name": "Conjuge Dantas",
  "role": "MEMBER",
  "spending_allowance": "1200.00"
}

### [J7-HAPPY-3] Solicitar Exportacao de Portabilidade LGPD (Art. 18 V) -> Esperado: 202 Accepted
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/profile/export
Authorization: Bearer {{authTenantA.response.body.access_token}}
X-Tenant-ID: {{tenantA}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "format": "JSON"
}

# ==============================================================================
# JORNADA 8 — SAAS ADMIN BACKOFFICE & ZERO-TRUST PRIVACY (BLINDAGEM LGPD)
# ==============================================================================

### [J8-HAPPY-1] PLATFORM_ADMIN Lista Metadados Comerciais de Tenants -> Esperado: 200 OK
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/tenants?page_size=20&status=ACTIVE
Authorization: Bearer {{authPlatformAdmin.response.body.access_token}}

### [J8-SAD-1] PLATFORM_ADMIN Tenta Ler Transacoes Financeiras Privadas -> Esperado: 403 Forbidden (Zero-Trust LGPD)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/transactions
Authorization: Bearer {{authPlatformAdmin.response.body.access_token}}
X-Tenant-ID: {{tenantA}}

### [J8-SAD-2] PLATFORM_ADMIN Tenta Ler Perfil Familiar Privado -> Esperado: 403 Forbidden (Zero-Trust LGPD)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{authPlatformAdmin.response.body.access_token}}
X-Tenant-ID: {{tenantA}}
